# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Scratch / debug leftovers ----
# These patterns exist because backup copies and throwaway verification dirs
# were committed once already — and they leaked reference solutions next to
# their own stubs (see docs/exercise-format.md, "Known gaps").
*.bak
*.bak_orig
*.orig
_tmp_*/
tmp_*/
*.tmp.*
*.tmp*.config.*
